summary: test scheduler nohz mode tick and other timer issues
description: |
    Verify workqueue and timer won't run on nohz cpu which has cpu hog process on.
    Verify the tick is stopped as expected in nohz_full cpus

    PARAMETERS

    SKIP_CASE="bzxxxxx"
    CASE_LIST="bzxxxxx"
contact: Chunyu Hu <chuhu@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - gcc
  - libgcc
  - glibc-devel
  - rpm-build
  - psmisc
recommend:
  - trace-cmd
  - git
  - glibc
  - numactl-devel
  - tuned
  - stalld
duration: 2h
extra-summary: /kernel/general/scheduler/sched_nohz_tick_timer
extra-task: /kernel/general/scheduler/sched_nohz_tick_timer
